# React Component Conventions

## Client Components

All feature components use `"use client"` since they manage state and user interactions. Only the root layout is a server component.

## State & Data Fetching

- Use `useState` + `useCallback` + `useEffect` for data fetching (no server components for data)
- Fetch from internal API routes (`/api/...`) using `fetch()`
- Wrap fetch callbacks in `useCallback` to avoid re-render loops
- Use `useMemo` for derived/filtered data

## Toast Notifications

Use Sonner for all user feedback:

```typescript
import { toast } from "sonner";

toast.success("Symptôme ajouté");
toast.error("Impossible de charger les données", {
  description: "Vérifiez votre connexion internet.",
});
```

